title: "Sparidae length-based stock assessment pipeline (LBSPR with a sequential-hermaphroditism amendment)"
abstract: "R pipeline for a single-season length-based assessment of exploited seabreams in Gibraltar waters: catch composition, length-based indicators, LBSPR spawning-potential-ratio with a sex-structured amendment, catch-curve cross-check, and an operating-model validation and misspecification stress battery."
